## Quickstart
1. Create a Python environment:
```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

2. Generate synthetic datasets:
```bash
python src/generate_synthetic_data.py
```

3. Ingest the generated CSV files into BigQuery under the `driiiportfolio` project. Use the project and schema patterns described in `docs/architecture_and_schema.md`.

4. Execute analytical views in BigQuery:
```sql
-- Run sql/01_create_views.sql
-- Run sql/02_validation.sql
```

5. Run the econometric model pipeline:
```bash
python src/run_econometric_model.py
```

